OL,3,GNEWSAContractors remove island that
OL,4,Ablocked bus route
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started to remove a
OL,7,Fnewly-installed traffic island after it
OL,8,Fleft a road in a village in
OL,9,FLeicestershire too narrow for buses to
OL,10,Faccess.
OL,12,FArriva Midlands said it had withdrawn
OL,13,Fits services from the centre of
OL,14,FQueniborough as drivers were unable to
OL,15,Ftravel along Rearsby Road without
OL,16,Fmounting the kerb.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
