OL,3,GNEWSAContractors remove island that
OL,4,Ablocked bus route
OL,5,
OL,6,FContractors working for developer David
OL,7,FWilson Homes returned on Monday to
OL,8,Fstart taking out the pedestrian refuge
OL,9,Fwhich they recently built as part of
OL,10,Fwork to increase the capacity of a
OL,11,Fnearby crossroads.
OL,13,FThe developer said it hoped Arriva's 5
OL,14,Fand 5A bus services would be restored
OL,15,Fby Thursday.
